#747: FILE: drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c:483:
+	if ((clen == PAGE_SIZE) && !is_partial_io(bvec)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

